* ⟪GTI18N_36d1f92f_000001⟫ defaults

When slicing, you may omit the high or low bounds to use their defaults instead.

The default is zero for the low bound and the length of the underlying ⟪GTI18N_36d1f92f_000002⟫ or array for the high bound.

